                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>146 volunteers from four AbbVie sites across Dublin&amp;nbsp;come together to refurbish outdoor recreational facilities at Our Lady Immaculate Senior School,&amp;nbsp;Darndale&lt;i>&lt;/i>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Nationally, almost 1,100 employees from eight AbbVie sites in Cork, Dublin, Sligo and Mayo contribute over 3,150 volunteer hours to company’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size: 0.8125rem;&quot;>Week of Possibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i>initiative&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Work in Ireland is part of wider international outreach involving 15,000 AbbVie volunteers from 50 countries&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </container3>
                    </container2>
